NvwFhteTl&_nc_oc=AdpCHcgQ3zeB5oL8ak3jnbgFER_4K9iR9KItGHgfYju2DEgs7SZmki_2HHn71d2k-wY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQXHPowSwzugowDzghsovtPFasmkSkMz_uRAEY5av71-qQ&oe=6B104032"}, "display_name": "3D Mahjong worlds - Quest", "keywords": ["mahjong", "board", "relax", "classic", "puzzle"], "long_description": "This is the VR implementation of the classic Mahjong game\n\nWhether you are a mahjong master or a beginner, this game will be your best choice!\nCreative design of solid 3D mahjong levels, and simple game rules, suitable for everyone!\nIt\u2019s transformed from the traditional matching game and brings a relaxing experience to players in a 3D way.\nBe the master and pair all the cubes to eliminate them on over 30 levels!\n\nGame features:\n\n- 60 levels\n- Mixed reality support\n- 5 Relaxing environment with daytime and night mode, plus a random option.\n- 8 Tile set\n- Classic and 3D style levels.\n- English, Hungarian and Simplified Chinese languages.\n- Rotate, move and zoom the board.\n\n\n{808240775651188}", "short_description": "This is the VR implementation of the classic Mahjong game\nCreative design of solid 3D mahjong levels and simple game rules!\n5 relaxing environments, 8 various colourful tile sets,60 levels and night mode! Mixed Reality support"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "logo2-chinese.png", "id": "1628457724592817", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75568725_1628457727926150_374747833840138475_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EIIBnUHibcEQ7kNvwHFZY9y&_nc_oc=Adp7p7YnE-T4AyjSWaDs5EVZoxddW8_pTAn9UH48zimZ0JtRZiwH5LIL4jqKBtA37RQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQXY4p0Ng3aO44Jwccevl4DDCTMQPuzDjPnWorsPYTp9mA&oe=6B104680"}, {"file_name": "landscapefull-chinese.png", "id": "1452552865375930", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculusc